{"title":"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Julie is preparing a speech for her class.  Her speech must last between one-half hour and three-quarters of an hour.  The ideal rate of speech is 150 words per minute.  If Julie speaks at the ideal rate, which of the following number of words would be an appropriate length for her speech?\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/8/928a2bfb4b36243537507623db7b0536caaf7a28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 2250 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 3000 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 4200 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 4350 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 5650$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"466\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes in an hour, we need a number of words between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/5/0b59cc81707b9467fe110c26dacc96d61a76d412.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{1}{2}\\times 60)\\times150=4500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"177\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/9/db92fff81b1717bf7391489e7520998ee89addd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{3}{4}\\times60)\\times150=6750$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"177\" height=\"38\" />.  The only such choice is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME\" title=\"1997 AJHSME\">1997 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"